  "title": "Your Page Title",
  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Brightlight Product Company Pricing Overview Buy Brightlight Pricing Integrations Customers Updates Changelog Help center Get started Sign up Sign in Contact Brightlight Invoicing for freelancers Start for free About Blog Contact Resources Help center Changelog Customers Legal Privacy Terms Moving from spreadsheets? Bring every client with you See how importing works Product Pricing Integrations Customers Company About Blog Contact Overview Buy Brightlight Built by freelancers. For the part of the job nobody likes. Brightlight is a small team spread across Europe. We spent years sending invoices from spreadsheets, so we built the tool we wanted. It started with one late invoice. In 2021 a client paid Ruggero four months late. Not out of malice. The invoice sat in an inbox, the reminder felt awkward to send, and nobody noticed until the rent was due. Every freelancer we talked to had the same story. Great at the work, worn out by the admin around it. Spreadsheets for invoices, sticky notes for reminders and a shoebox for tax. Brightlight puts all of it in one place. You write the invoice, your client pays from a link, the reminders send themselves and the tax is alre",
